# Compose only from `@/components/ui`

When editing Vue in `apps/web`, reuse these components. Do not recreate their look with Tailwind on raw HTML.

## Actions
- `Button` — `primary` | `secondary` | `ghost` | `destructive` (+ `loading` / `disabled`)
- `ButtonAccent` — outline only (no gradient)
- `IconButton` — icon + `label` (aria)

## Forms
- `FormField` — label + hint + **error 422**; slot gets `{ invalid }`
- `Input` — `text` | `number` | `password` | `email` | `date` | `datetime-local` | `search` | `tel`
- `PasswordInput` — senha com mostrar/ocultar (olho)
- `Textarea`, `Select`, `Checkbox`, `Switch`
- `SearchField`, `MaskedBox`

## Feedback / overlay
- `Banner`, `InlineAlert`, `Badge`, `Spinner`, `Skeleton`
- Toasts: `useToastStore()` (`success` / `error` / `info`) — host is already in `App.vue`
- `AppDialog`, `ConfirmDialog`
- `EmptyState` — título + descrição + slot `action`
- `Pagination` — `page` / `lastPage` (`update:page`)
- `Tabs` — segmento (`v-model` + `items`; `block` para largura total)
- `LineChart` — série (Chart.js; cores via tokens Soft Violet)
- `NavBadge` — contador numérico da nav (some se `count` for 0; `99+`)

## Layout
- `PageHeader`, `SurfaceCard`
- `ListCard` — grouped row + chevron (no pastel variants)
- `SidebarNavItem` — item da nav (shell)
- `ClinicShell` — `components/patterns` (sidebar + bottom nav)
- `PermissionGate` — `components/patterns`; slot só com a permission
- `ClientSearchBar` — `components/patterns`; busca com debounce (`search`)
- `MoneyDisplay` — `components/patterns`; BRL (`formatBRL`); `size` `md` | `lg`
- `StockStatusBadge` — `components/patterns`; Normal / estoque baixo / reposição / negativo
- `ItemLineRow` — `components/patterns`; produto + quantidade + preço opcional + remover (protocolos / vendas)
- `WizardStepper` — `components/patterns`; passos mobile (venda)
- `AgendaEventCard` — `components/patterns`; evento da agenda (cliente, horário, status, profissional, tratamento)
- `MetricCard` — `components/patterns`; label + valor (slot) + hint
- `RankBar` — `components/patterns`; ranking com barra proporcional (tokens)
- `NotificationInboxItem` — `components/patterns`; linha do inbox (título, message, tempo relativo, unread)

## Tokens
Use Tailwind mapped from `tokens.css` (`bg-canvas`, `bg-surface`, `text-title`, `text-muted`, `bg-brand`, `rounded-card`, `border-border-subtle`, …). Never hardcode `#5956A6`, `#F2F2F7`, or new shadows.

## Extending the system
1. Add or change the primitive in `apps/web/src/components/ui/`.
2. Show default, disabled, invalid, and loading on `apps/web/src/pages/DevUiPage.vue`.
3. Only then import it from a feature.

`components/ui` must not import `features/*`.
